                                                "sense_id": "66016da8-8e72-3c0b-a71f-862a66381565",
                                                "text": "c. 1850s-1870s, Edward Minister and Son, The Gazette of Fashion and Cutting-Room Companion\nThe health of the Vice was proposed in appropriate language; in replying, Mr. Marriott thanked the company […]"
